{"script":"wt_c2_07_1_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]为了解决红水晶，我们需要 1 个魔焰爆桶哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]如果时间太长的话，我耽误我们的采矿计划的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“石头”贾马尔","text":"[show]麻烦你们了，请尽快把爆炸物带过来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"“石头”的请求"}